我…

891
00:43:25,580 --> 00:43:27,341
我都從來冇聽過你笑

892
00:43:27,382 --> 00:43:28,983
係啊，好耐冇笑

893
00:43:29,464 --> 00:43:30,544
真係好喇

894
00:43:31,938 --> 00:43:32,900
Mr Blue

895
00:43:32,940 --> 00:43:34,742
you did it right

896
00:43:34,983 --> 00:43:37,346
But soon I'll be
the next to ride

897
00:43:38,068 --> 00:43:39,389
Creeping over

898
00:43:39,591 --> 00:43:42,354
now my hand
is on your shell

899
00:43:43,117 --> 00:43:46,281
I'll remember you this

900
00:43:46,442 --> 00:43:48,966
I'll remember you this

901
00:43:49,006 --> 00:43:50,008
你好少去街㗎嗬？

902
00:43:50,048 --> 00:43:51,129
